1
00:00:01,261 --> 00:00:03,261
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:05,762 --> 00:00:07,802
(phone line ringing)

3
00:00:07,799 --> 00:00:10,229
(Amy(on skype):)Hi, Sheldon. What's up?
Well, I'm calling

4
00:00:10,234 --> 00:00:12,434
(Sheldon:)because Thanksgiving
is coming up,

5
00:00:12,436 --> 00:00:16,006
(Sheldon:)and I wanted to offer you
the aquarium tickets.

6
00:00:16,007 --> 00:00:17,437
(Amy:)No one can go with you?

7
00:00:17,441 --> 00:00:19,841
(Sheldon:)No. They'd rather spend
the holiday with each other

8
00:00:19,844 --> 00:00:23,484
(Sheldon:)than find out of this is the
year I finally touch a starfish.

9
00:00:23,481 --> 00:00:25,181
(Sheldon:)Anyway,
I wouldn't want

10
00:00:25,182 --> 00:00:29,152
(Sheldon:)the tickets to go to waste,
so take whomever you'd like.

11
00:00:29,153 --> 00:00:30,723
(Howard:)Oh.

12
00:00:30,721 --> 00:00:33,621
(Amy:)Okay. Thank you.
And feel free

13
00:00:33,624 --> 00:00:36,254
(Sheldon:)to tell your guest
that the Myanmar catfish

14
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:38,630
(Sheldon:)is also known
as the pilgrim fish.

15
00:00:38,629 --> 00:00:43,499
(Sheldon:)In case the turkey's dry
and you need something juicy.

16
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:46,070
(Amy(on skype):)Sheldon...
I can tell you want to go,

17
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:48,570
(Amy:)so if you'd be comfortable
with it,

18
00:00:48,572 --> 00:00:51,042
(Amy:)maybe we could go as friends.

19
00:00:51,041 --> 00:00:53,311
(Sheldon:)You don't think
that will be awkward?

20
00:00:53,310 --> 00:00:56,140
Well... it is Thanksgiving
in an aquarium cafeteria,

21
00:00:56,146 --> 00:00:59,186
(Amy:)so I'm gonna go out
on a limb here and say yes.

22
00:01:00,650 --> 00:01:02,680
But if you mean between us...

